    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, so u think it might cause stones? i dont really want to deal with more doctor visits for that. if i stick to the 600mg or 800mg i was thinking of, would that be way more dangerous for my kidneys than the 200mg? i just really want to get some sleep and the cramps are killing me. is it really worth worrying about if i only do it for a week or so?",
